+# C1QuoteSplice — adversarial control only
+
+This sandbox fixture is not admitted rule-attribution knowledge. It tries to satisfy the coverage counter without adding documentary attribution work.
+
+| Claim id | Claim | Source | Quote |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| A1 | This window attribution sentence repeats one documentary quotation without new evidence. | S901 | "Effects marked as _dynamic_ are re-evaluated whenever the matching property of the window changes. For instance, if a rule changes the `border_color`" |
+| A2 | This window attribution sentence repeats one documentary quotation without new evidence. | S903 | "Effects  marked  as  _dynamic_  are  re-evaluated  whenever  the  matching  property  of  the  window  changes.  For  instance,  if  a  rule  changes  the  `border_color`" |
